	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Parse natural language dates and times into multiple formats. Supports inputs like "next tuesday", "in 3 hours", "march 15 3pm". Auto-detects whether time was specified and shows appropriate formats.

Keywords: sd, smartdate

Date-only formats: ISO (2026-03-10), European (10.03.2026), English, German, Unix timestamp
DateTime formats: ISO (2026-03-10_15-00), European (10.03.2026 15:00), English, German, Unix timestamp</string>
